+// way stock Firefox does on that OS. This build only compiles the Linux table
+// below, so a Windows identity drew Thai, Lao, Mongolian, Cherokee and emoji
+// with other faces than stock 152.0.4 on Windows (75 of 168 per-script
+// widths matched), and with Windows' font.name-list prefs applied, scripts
+// the Linux table does not name for a Windows allowlist rendered as .notdef.
+// The two tables are stock's, copied verbatim from gfxWindowsPlatform.cpp and
+// gfxPlatformMac.cpp (FIREFOX_156_0_1_RELEASE; unchanged since 152.0.4).
+namespace camou_fallback {
